{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a7f478eba475112025783787421802e281e79e8f10130f2352f29d862d2d6698", "ja": "（クリスマス公演のあと。雪歩が突然、\nお客さん達の見送りをしたいと言い出した）", "zh": "（圣诞公演结束后，\n雪步突然提出想亲自送观众离场）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3b75679bed04648898513ccfb99cc8f3916dfc115bafe43eb6bf26b615cf71af", "ja": "（急遽、場所を作って、お見送りを始めたのだが……）", "zh": "（所以临时腾出了空间，让雪步目送客人离去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "217d983370001f2ae38914751d60ce115743a589b7b0cfdf31b413f3f114e6a7", "ja": "今日は観に来てくださって、ありがとうございました。\nまた来てくださいね。", "zh": "感谢各位今天前来观赏。\n请务必再度光临喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "edec37141b0bd7a3f6f1abbbe99ebec3f13d83aae68b027645fce408b5552b48", "ja": "本当に本当に、ありがとうございました。\n……さようなら～。", "zh": "真的真的，非常谢谢大家……\n再见～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1004_p", "source_sha256": "84850eb2e79495363026d823f240b756e57716547d033232f87ddfc367277cbc", "ja": "雪歩、今のお客さんで最後だ。お疲れさま。", "zh": "雪步，刚才那就是最后一位观众啰，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "de1cf19e8ca5200431d2e34e2e7603a4d1533071867f9becc23b1a444dd7d719", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます。\n私なんかのワガママを聞いてくれて……。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n谢谢你愿意听我的任性要求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7ec955fa324907815432c53aaabff7645eb5a8c4e20657deeb30f99778f66c17", "ja": "いや。でも、雪歩がここまでするとは思わなかったよ。\n何か理由があるのか？", "zh": "别这么说。不过我没想到雪步会做到这种地步，\n有什么理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d111769f1222c65544f6aebdfe26469a804992d39c952265a6a9fe31a134c310", "ja": "えっと……と、特に、\n何かあったわけじゃないんですけど……。", "zh": "那个……\n并、并没有什么重大的理由……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ca72f8fd37360f137d67e2cee6f63c2e8fcb9fe3d56413e60ef329084ad9c3bf", "ja": "今日はクリスマスで、特別な日だから……\nそんな日に、公演を観に来てくれた人達に……。", "zh": "只是因为今天是圣诞节，是特别的日子……\n对于在这种日子还愿意来看公演的人们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b496ada446cc3e20aefe4f9afa23fd0f7a18f69b751cd879977797c17022c825", "ja": "何か、贈り物をしたいって思ったんです。\nステージ以外でも……。", "zh": "我想送他们一点礼物。\n算是除了表演以外的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1010_p", "source_sha256": "248baf671d092dcf4459fbfa97f925a65f2adb9d29de159db7e52895b883c611", "ja": "お客さんも、雪歩のサプライズプレゼントに\n喜んでたな。みんな笑顔だったぞ。", "zh": "观众们也对雪步送来的惊喜感到很开心呢。\n大家都带着满脸笑容喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "356ba0e8f63bf6dbc849f54543f204ee1e2184aad931b2d7682c713664c4ef00", "ja": "えへへ、自分でもびっくりです。\nこんなに近くで、ちゃんと挨拶できて……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我自己也很惊讶。\n居然能在这么近的距离下跟大家一一打招呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "16e832f7aa7b1f716c11343b1b24fb3e50b8bbd6ed1d6cd92d2b18007dd0f8e6", "ja": "でも、おかげで、みなさんの笑顔が見られました。\n思いきって、やってみてよかったです。", "zh": "但也多亏如此，我才能看见大家的笑容。\n有下定决心这么做，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6b4a93b85c77a59a6e307b91e83511d65cb15c04a695961e1b92a9eb5fcf0b1f", "ja": "{$P$}には、\n迷惑をかけちゃいましたけど……。", "zh": "虽然好像给{$P$}\n添了麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e5a60f6046ceadef7c3719c61bb1e69ab4a10072af2c8a022008eea6d0feaacc", "ja": "そのくらい、迷惑でもなんでもないよ。\nお客さんに喜んでもらうのがアイドルの仕事だ。", "zh": "这点小事算不上麻烦啦。\n毕竟让观众们开心是偶像的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1015_p", "source_sha256": "148070173cd63b7ebcf4d74ea1997b5173acaa74ae32d44e372b1c55aa59d370", "ja": "アイドルの仕事をサポートするのが、\nプロデューサーの仕事だよ。", "zh": "而从旁协助偶像，\n则是制作人的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a50863d4a16bbd928a4df8e5cb3d9d8dbbce87aed57524c6c92dfd16bd1e8a85", "ja": "{$P$}……\nありがとうございます。えへへ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n谢谢你，嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0044_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f438f5a794fcc4576d49580a597ae334e9b13a8d17d3fca7d5ea7974ea6e1a1e", "ja": "私、お見送りより……\n今が一番、ドキドキしてるかもです……。", "zh": "比起送客人离开……\n现在这个时候说不定才最让我心跳不已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
